<Chapter id="ch-07" num="07" end="remove things.">
  <Diagram slot="graphic" />
  <p class="beat">Today I'm a design technologist at Global Philanthropic, a philanthropy consultancy working across the UK, Europe and Asia. I joined as the designer. Then I kept running into problems that design alone couldn't solve, so I started experimenting with AI and automation, and building systems around it.</p>
  <p class="beat">The work I'm proudest of didn't start with making anything. It started with understanding how the work actually happened, finding the gaps and the patterns, and taking things out. Only then did I build something better, and it became a product clients pay for.</p>
  <div slot="after">
    <blockquote class="pull"><p>Designers don't always have to arrive with an answer. Sometimes the job is to take something away.</p></blockquote>
    <div class="moment">
      <p>One set of people use AI like an advanced Google search. The other set wield it. Most of what I do now is help people move from the first group to the second.</p>
      <ToolTag tool="AI" />
    </div>
  </div>
</Chapter>
